+/** FG-154: rows whose height the file stores (ht, not customHeight) are marked
+    manual during import so the post-import optimal-height pass skips measuring
+    them; the pass then re-measures only rows the file gave no height. After the
+    pass, releaseStoredRowHeights() clears that temporary manual flag again, so
